    "detailed_description": "Welcome to <strong>Safelight</strong>: the first-person puzzle horror, and debut game, from BiMonocle Games.<br><br>You are an amateur photographer, and you find yourself suddenly alone on a Victorian-themed cruise ship, previously filled with passengers. As you explore it becomes apparent that entire areas of the ship have vanished. You're left with nothing but your wits and a makeshift darkroom that you've set up in your cabin. Hidden rolls of film help you recover areas that had disappeared and reveal new secrets about the supernatural elements in play.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PUZZLES</h2>Navigate the vacant cruise ship while solving puzzles as you attempt to piece together the story behind the vanishing passengers.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DANGEROUS ENTITIES</h2>Avoid hostile entities that roam the ship and are drawn to bright light sources.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EERIE ENVIRONMENTS</h2>Realistic graphics, sinister sound design, and dark, somber environments create constant tension.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MINIMAL USER INTERFACES</h2>Simplified HUD and minimal user interfaces improve immersion, further adding to the fear.",
